WEBVTT

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:46.330
Szabo! Are you there, Szabo?

00:01:47.466 --> 00:01:49.726
Lord Nene, is something the matter?

00:01:53.433 --> 00:01:56.873
It seems that Blue Dragon
has a new power.

00:01:57.266 --> 00:01:58.266
Impossible!

00:01:58.333 --> 00:02:00.073
It seems! It seems!

00:02:00.233 --> 00:02:03.033
And so, what do you intend to do?

00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:06.930
They are now approaching
the capital of Galda.

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:09.530
Can I leave this to you?

00:02:10.233 --> 00:02:11.803
Can I?! Can I?!

00:02:12.266 --> 00:02:12.926
As you wish.

00:02:17.966 --> 00:02:18.966
Now then...

00:02:19.300 --> 00:02:21.600
I wonder what kind of power it is.

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:27.170
Now with Logi out of the way,

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:31.600
there's no doubt that I am
Lord Nene's most trusted aide!

00:02:32.766 --> 00:02:37.666
THE POWERFUL ONE

00:02:48.766 --> 00:02:51.796
So, where do we head now?

00:02:52.100 --> 00:02:56.170
For now, we'll hit the other ruins
starting with the closest first.

00:02:56.766 --> 00:03:00.396
The next closest one is
Jiro's hometown, right?

00:03:00.500 --> 00:03:01.170
Pointless.

00:03:01.433 --> 00:03:02.103
Huh?

00:03:02.166 --> 00:03:03.996
My whole village was
burned to the ground.

00:03:04.233 --> 00:03:05.273
There's nothing left.

00:03:05.466 --> 00:03:09.266
But there might still be
one or two clues left.

00:03:09.666 --> 00:03:11.726
We won't know until we check it out.

00:03:11.766 --> 00:03:12.996
I said, there's nothing there!

00:03:16.033 --> 00:03:17.033
Where are you going, maro?

00:03:17.066 --> 00:03:18.066
For a walk.

00:03:21.733 --> 00:03:23.703
What's with him, acting all weird?

00:03:55.933 --> 00:03:59.073
Look at this dirty thing she's got!

00:03:59.166 --> 00:04:00.996
Yeah, let's go throw it away!

00:04:01.033 --> 00:04:02.173
Give it back!

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:02.870
Shut up!

00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:05.500
Let's go!

00:04:06.066 --> 00:04:06.726
Hold it!

00:04:07.866 --> 00:04:09.866
That's my little sister's!
Give it back!

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:11.200
Brother!

00:04:17.366 --> 00:04:19.126
Hey, Brother!

00:04:19.166 --> 00:04:20.896
Brother... Hey!

00:04:21.966 --> 00:04:22.966
Are you okay?

00:04:23.733 --> 00:04:25.433
Huh? What?

00:04:26.500 --> 00:04:27.170
Oh!

00:04:33.266 --> 00:04:34.996
I couldn't save it.

00:04:35.566 --> 00:04:37.326
I'm sorry for being
such a weak big brother.

00:04:37.866 --> 00:04:42.266
No, that's not true.
Thanks for coming to my rescue.

00:04:42.933 --> 00:04:47.833
I'll get stronger so I'll be able
to protect you next time.

00:04:49.533 --> 00:04:50.533
I promise.

00:04:51.133 --> 00:04:51.803
Yeah!

00:05:08.433 --> 00:05:11.973
Lucky me. I found the kid
from the other time right away.

00:05:12.666 --> 00:05:14.626
It was almost too easy.

00:05:15.433 --> 00:05:17.373
I thought you died!

00:05:17.733 --> 00:05:19.073
What?!

00:05:23.433 --> 00:05:24.533
So I missed, huh?

00:05:24.933 --> 00:05:27.003
I guess you've gotten
slightly better, eh?!

00:05:27.700 --> 00:05:29.370
I thought I took care of you!

00:05:38.033 --> 00:05:42.403
You're such a pest!
I will now have my revenge!

00:05:42.566 --> 00:05:43.626
Revenge?

00:05:44.166 --> 00:05:45.826
That's my line!

00:05:45.866 --> 00:05:47.596
I'll defeat you guys,
as many times as it takes!

00:05:57.633 --> 00:06:00.603
Oh! That guy is...
from the other time...

00:06:01.100 --> 00:06:02.700
Let's get rid of him, fast!

00:06:12.966 --> 00:06:17.926
I am Rocket Bomber Sai!
The fourth of Szabo's Mighty Quartet!

00:06:19.300 --> 00:06:24.530
I am Flashing Bladed Kesu!
The third of Szabo's Mighty Quartet!

00:06:25.133 --> 00:06:30.003
I am Knife Armed Mai!
The second of Szabo's Mighty Quartet!

00:06:31.033 --> 00:06:36.203
I am Double Blaster Ku!
The leader of Szabo's Mighty Quartet!

00:06:38.666 --> 00:06:41.466
Together, we're Szabo's Mighty Quartet!

00:06:44.533 --> 00:06:48.633
These are my loyal minions,
Szabo's Mighty Quartet!

00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:51.800
Get them, you guys!

00:06:56.466 --> 00:06:57.866
There are five of them all together.

00:06:58.166 --> 00:06:59.166
It doesn't matter.

00:07:01.833 --> 00:07:03.033
Alright!

00:07:08.100 --> 00:07:09.900
Don't stop! Keep going!

00:07:10.066 --> 00:07:11.066
Alright...

00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:15.830
Is that all?

00:07:15.866 --> 00:07:16.526
What?!

00:07:22.366 --> 00:07:23.726
It's my turn now!

00:07:31.900 --> 00:07:33.000
You're mine!

00:07:35.533 --> 00:07:37.033
Bomb attack!

00:08:01.366 --> 00:08:06.866
Come on, what're you doing?!
Shouldn't we retreat for now?!

00:08:08.066 --> 00:08:11.066
Hell no! I won't turn my back
on small fry opponents!

00:08:12.333 --> 00:08:13.573
Time to bump it up a notch.

00:08:14.933 --> 00:08:19.673
You idiot! Forget your pride!
You can't win the way you are now.

00:08:19.866 --> 00:08:22.466
Now! Simultaneous attack!

00:08:23.200 --> 00:08:26.030
Damn it! W-Waves of Rage!

00:08:32.200 --> 00:08:33.200
What?!

00:08:39.633 --> 00:08:40.833
They escaped, huh?

00:08:42.266 --> 00:08:43.266
Damn it!

00:08:43.366 --> 00:08:45.726
I told you we have to
defeat them, didn't I?!

00:08:46.066 --> 00:08:49.066
Calm down, Jiro.
That was our only choice.

00:08:49.100 --> 00:08:50.570
Don't give me that!

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:54.000
We ran because you lost your nerve!

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:56.000
I lost my nerve?!

00:08:56.400 --> 00:08:59.070
That's right!
You're the one who told me to retreat!

00:08:59.366 --> 00:09:04.066
Yeah, I was.
But it's because you're weak!

00:09:04.166 --> 00:09:05.896
What?! You're saying I'm weak?!

00:09:06.233 --> 00:09:07.773
What the hell was that?

00:09:08.200 --> 00:09:10.000
You were too stiff in that fight.

00:09:10.266 --> 00:09:12.626
To me, it was like
digging your own grave.

00:09:13.200 --> 00:09:15.970
That's why I said you're weak.

00:09:16.266 --> 00:09:19.596
Sh-Shut up! What do you know?!

00:09:20.633 --> 00:09:23.933
Don't carry too much
baggage when you fight.

00:09:24.433 --> 00:09:28.473
Unload some of that the next time
you summon me, okay?

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:36.470
Was there an explosion here?

00:09:36.500 --> 00:09:37.670
Is it Jiro, maro?

00:09:37.933 --> 00:09:38.933
Probably...

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:40.900
Where did he go?

00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:05.400
Give back our children!

00:10:12.733 --> 00:10:14.703
Jiro, go on ahead!

00:10:14.933 --> 00:10:15.933
What about you, dad?!

00:10:16.166 --> 00:10:17.996
I'm going to save Gina and your mom!

00:10:18.766 --> 00:10:19.996
I'm going with you!

00:10:20.033 --> 00:10:21.573
No! Don't come with me!

00:10:21.966 --> 00:10:23.626
You keep running!

00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:37.170
Dad!

00:10:47.633 --> 00:10:48.303
Dad!

00:10:49.066 --> 00:10:50.996
Mom! Gina!

00:10:52.166 --> 00:10:54.396
Gina! Hey! Gina!

00:10:56.966 --> 00:10:58.566
Brother...

00:11:00.400 --> 00:11:01.070
Gina!

00:11:01.633 --> 00:11:03.273
Jiro...

00:11:05.666 --> 00:11:06.326
Dad!

00:11:10.566 --> 00:11:11.996
J-Jiro...

00:11:12.533 --> 00:11:14.173
Why did you come back?

00:11:15.166 --> 00:11:17.966
I'll save you now! I'll save you!

00:11:18.500 --> 00:11:22.570
Get out of here quickly...
This house is about to collapse...

00:11:22.766 --> 00:11:23.426
No way!

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:29.270
I promised Gina that I'd get stronger
so I could protect her, and everyone!

00:11:32.033 --> 00:11:42.473
Go, my son... You must live.
And...find...your strength...

00:11:43.733 --> 00:11:44.733
Dad!

00:12:07.533 --> 00:12:10.133
If I hadn't run away then...

00:12:11.066 --> 00:12:11.726
No...

00:12:12.400 --> 00:12:13.870
I decided to get strong...

00:12:14.833 --> 00:12:15.503
Jiro.

00:12:17.966 --> 00:12:18.626
Kluke.

00:12:22.233 --> 00:12:23.603
How'd you get that wound?

00:12:23.733 --> 00:12:24.733
It's just a scratch.

00:12:24.933 --> 00:12:28.303
Was there an enemy here?
Why didn't you tell everyone?

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:32.730
Sh-Shut up! I can fight alone!

00:12:55.466 --> 00:12:56.126
Who's there?!

00:12:59.633 --> 00:13:01.503
We sure run into each other a lot today!

00:13:13.166 --> 00:13:14.566
Did we get him this time?

00:13:20.400 --> 00:13:22.270
Were you able to unload a bit?

00:13:22.300 --> 00:13:23.570
Sh-Shut up.

00:13:23.666 --> 00:13:25.196
Guess not...

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:29.100
Smash!

00:13:40.633 --> 00:13:41.303
Again!

00:13:41.400 --> 00:13:42.070
Jiro!

00:13:44.766 --> 00:13:46.766
It's the same no matter
how many times you try.

00:13:48.533 --> 00:13:49.203
Damn it...

00:13:49.233 --> 00:13:52.833
Get it together, Jiro!
Don't blame me if we have to run again!

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:54.370
I won't run away anymore!

00:13:54.666 --> 00:13:55.796
Jiro!

00:13:58.566 --> 00:13:59.866
The other brats, huh?

00:14:00.166 --> 00:14:03.396
Alright, men! Merge!

00:14:03.433 --> 00:14:04.103
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

00:14:05.366 --> 00:14:06.366
What's that?!

00:14:34.066 --> 00:14:38.166
What's this huge thing?!
Oh, and we just watched as it got merged!

00:14:38.533 --> 00:14:41.203
Jiro! Why didn't you call us?!

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:44.070
Stay out of this! I can fight alone!

00:14:44.100 --> 00:14:46.770
What're you saying at a time like this?!
Are you an idiot?!

00:14:46.800 --> 00:14:49.430
Be quiet! Let's go, Minotaur!

00:14:49.766 --> 00:14:52.596
Can you, Jiro? In that state?

00:14:52.833 --> 00:14:54.233
I've gotten stronger!

00:14:54.566 --> 00:14:56.066
I'll prove it!

00:15:06.200 --> 00:15:07.200
Eat this!

00:15:11.966 --> 00:15:12.626
Jiro!

00:15:14.066 --> 00:15:16.166
Stay away! This is my revenge!

00:15:16.566 --> 00:15:18.196
I don't care.

00:15:18.333 --> 00:15:19.003
What?

00:15:19.200 --> 00:15:22.200
I don't really get what's
going on with you.

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:27.100
But before I get caught up
in thinking, I'll just fight!

00:15:28.800 --> 00:15:31.170
Come, Blue Dragon!

00:15:38.366 --> 00:15:42.196
So you've finally appeared, Blue Dragon!
I've waited patiently for you!

00:15:42.633 --> 00:15:44.633
I anticipated this, so...

00:15:55.700 --> 00:15:57.230
I-It's huge!

00:15:58.766 --> 00:16:00.696
How about that, Blue Dragon?!

00:16:01.233 --> 00:16:03.273
Initiate the Second Project!

00:16:03.633 --> 00:16:05.673
Mark Two, activate!

00:16:05.933 --> 00:16:08.403
I'll be glad to take it on!

00:16:15.600 --> 00:16:17.030
You jerk!

00:16:24.700 --> 00:16:25.700
Shu!

00:16:31.466 --> 00:16:32.666
Damn it!

00:16:34.333 --> 00:16:36.503
Go, Blue Dragon!

00:16:36.533 --> 00:16:38.403
My pleasure!

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:42.670
Zola!

00:16:42.700 --> 00:16:43.370
Shu!

00:16:43.733 --> 00:16:45.833
Alright! I'm going in too, maro!

00:16:45.866 --> 00:16:46.526
No, hold it!

00:17:27.266 --> 00:17:29.626
H-Hey, you okay?

00:17:30.033 --> 00:17:36.133
Yeah. Seeing the way he battles...
It became silly how much I was thinking.

00:17:42.133 --> 00:17:43.573
Hey, Minotaur.

00:17:43.900 --> 00:17:44.570
What?

00:17:44.800 --> 00:17:45.830
Hit me.

00:17:46.300 --> 00:17:46.970
Huh?

00:17:48.066 --> 00:17:49.066
Just do it!

00:17:50.566 --> 00:17:51.866
Alright then.

00:17:52.766 --> 00:17:53.766
There!

00:17:56.033 --> 00:17:58.033
Ow, ow, ow...

00:18:01.866 --> 00:18:04.726
What? What's going on?!

00:18:07.233 --> 00:18:08.533
That hurt.

00:18:10.033 --> 00:18:11.273
You okay, Jiro?

00:18:14.133 --> 00:18:15.173
You hit me too hard.

00:18:19.500 --> 00:18:21.770
You're the one who told me to.

00:18:23.133 --> 00:18:24.373
Are they fighting amongst themselves?

00:18:25.566 --> 00:18:27.126
Sorry to keep you waiting, Szabo!

00:18:27.733 --> 00:18:28.733
What?!

00:18:29.066 --> 00:18:30.366
I'll settle this!

00:18:30.666 --> 00:18:31.896
What?!

00:18:35.533 --> 00:18:37.303
Let's go, Minotaur!

00:18:37.633 --> 00:18:39.173
Right!

00:18:41.266 --> 00:18:45.766
I thought this might happen...
This time for sure! Eat this!

00:18:45.800 --> 00:18:48.070
Szabotic Bomber!

00:18:51.233 --> 00:18:53.903
You impudent! Here's more!

00:18:57.300 --> 00:19:01.030
What?! Come out! Come out!
Come out, I say!

00:19:05.466 --> 00:19:07.266
Shouldn't we help them, maro?!

00:19:07.466 --> 00:19:08.726
No, hold on!

00:19:10.866 --> 00:19:14.566
Did you think my efficiency
would drop if I got wet?!

00:19:14.900 --> 00:19:16.900
I thought this might happen.

00:19:17.500 --> 00:19:19.830
Szabomit Screw!

00:19:23.133 --> 00:19:24.133
What?!

00:19:24.166 --> 00:19:26.066
Is this supposed to be an attack?

00:19:27.466 --> 00:19:32.366
This improved Szabo is
an all-around land and water battle robot!

00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:34.170
Szabotect Laser!

00:19:35.200 --> 00:19:36.200
Conquer!

00:19:46.766 --> 00:19:47.866
Spin!

00:19:50.133 --> 00:19:51.573
W-What?!

00:19:51.666 --> 00:19:53.766
What's that, maro?!

00:19:56.533 --> 00:20:00.873
Surging emotions make one forget
sorrow and suppress happiness.

00:20:01.000 --> 00:20:02.500
When everything ends,

00:20:02.533 --> 00:20:06.073
the soldier burns with rage once again
and is left with nothing...

00:20:06.566 --> 00:20:08.866
In the second chapter
of the Extra Seven,

00:20:09.400 --> 00:20:12.630
it said the power of the soldier
could be sealed

00:20:12.666 --> 00:20:15.226
by suppressing emotion and
burning with rage once again.

00:20:15.433 --> 00:20:16.433
The opposite may be true.

00:20:16.666 --> 00:20:21.896
Controlling emotions after exposing them
may be the key to attaining power.

00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:25.070
This probably means...

00:20:31.666 --> 00:20:33.166
Jiro's found new power!

00:20:35.366 --> 00:20:36.896
Sky Terror!

00:21:01.733 --> 00:21:05.603
We'll settle things on our end, too!
Blue Explosion!

00:21:21.666 --> 00:21:24.596
Hey, it seems you've gotten
a little better, huh?

00:21:27.233 --> 00:21:29.033
No, I'm weak...

00:21:31.433 --> 00:21:32.103
So...

00:21:33.500 --> 00:21:35.000
I'll get stronger.

00:21:36.166 --> 00:21:38.326
Dad, that will be okay, right?

00:21:42.800 --> 00:21:43.470
Jiro!

00:21:44.466 --> 00:21:46.166
That was awesome, Jiro!

00:21:46.866 --> 00:21:49.596
Hey! Was that Minotaur's new power?

00:21:49.833 --> 00:21:53.033
What? You're done getting
more power already, maro?

00:21:53.666 --> 00:21:56.766
Yeah, I think so.

00:21:57.600 --> 00:21:59.500
Yeah. I think so, too.

00:22:01.066 --> 00:22:02.726
Alright, let's go, everyone!

00:22:02.966 --> 00:22:03.966
- Yeah!
- Yeah!

00:22:16.133 --> 00:22:18.403
Is something the matter, Delphinium?

00:22:18.666 --> 00:22:19.666
I have a report...

00:22:20.300 --> 00:22:20.970
What is it?

00:22:21.233 --> 00:22:27.073
It seems Blue Dragon and Minotaur have
succeeded in deciphering the Extra Seven.

00:22:27.366 --> 00:22:28.366
I see.

00:22:30.900 --> 00:22:34.300
Continue gathering information.

00:22:35.233 --> 00:22:35.903
Yes, sir.

00:24:18.066 --> 00:24:20.226
Shu meets a boy who is striving
to become a Shadow Wielder.

00:24:20.266 --> 00:24:22.626
Before he knows it,
Shu ends up becoming his teacher.

00:24:22.666 --> 00:24:25.996
Hey, guys. What do you think is necessary
to become a Shadow Wielder?

00:24:26.033 --> 00:24:27.533
- Tinkering with machines.
- Revenge.

00:24:27.566 --> 00:24:28.826
The ABCs of love.

00:24:28.866 --> 00:24:31.196
Boobs and underwear, maro.

00:24:31.233 --> 00:24:32.733
That's enough, you guys.

00:24:32.900 --> 00:24:35.800
Next on Blue Dragon:
The Shadow Wielder's Apprentice
